abstract: >-
  A folder of research papers. Decay: Decay by Collapse on Separate Internal Spaces. Attributes: the section document Attributes: are the seven internal spaces enough? and nine documents on which measured attributes of matter need an internal space of their own. Relativity: Reconciling the Schwarzschild Solution with Conservation of Mass-Energy (version 1.2.0),
  which supersedes Why Is It Impossible to Escape from a Black Hole? (version 1.3.2), How Compact Notation Hides the Static Reference Frame,
  and articles for teachers and curious readers, with the validation data. Bridge: Geometry: Where, When and What;
  granularity, collapse, a force-carrying excitation, their reconciliation with spin and curvature, and the constraints
  from baryon numbers. Internal Spaces: electric charge, colour, flavour, spin, inertia, gravitational coupling and charge coupling.
  Not peer-reviewed.
